{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は・"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てぃすの\nHappy Birthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ね、\nひなとかりんちゃんで\n早めのお祝いをやったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっちゃんが\nほしいゆってた\nおっきいスヌーピーをあげた٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و\nめっちゃ喜んでくれてよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも\n元気でうるさいゆうりでいてね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりに全部ぜんぶ\n相談しているため\n私のここ2、3年のすべての感情と行動を知っているんじゃないのかとも思ってしまうくらい、、聞き上手なので、人間不信に陥りやすい私が話せる数少ない人間～(多分人類で3人しかいない)、メールとか連絡を人ととるのが苦手なのに何かあると自分からすぐ連絡しちゃう・唯一。。ここまで同じ人と一緒にいたことないので大切な存在でしかない・これからもよろしく～٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野もおめぴち☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天の\n収録してきたっ٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و\nキャンプロケ！ぜひみてね～・\n頑張ったよえへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の\nのぎ天で楽屋の席の話したやつをみてくれて\nわざわざずーが\nあの話面白かった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って連絡くれたの٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و嬉しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーから\nそういうの言われるとうれしいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は純奈に\nくっつき虫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一枚目は、\nじゅんなの腕に上に寝てる図"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二枚目は、\nみんなで話してる時\nじゅんなの背中にはりつく図"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\nみり愛にあたりつよくいくのブーム。\n無邪気な目でみてくるから\n死んだ目でこれから私をみなさい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と指導してる(どんなだよ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nあやねちゃんを笑わせ隊。\nじゅんなとかみり愛といると\n絶対あやねちゃんもくっついてくる！(可愛い)\nあやねちゃんを笑わせようと頑張ってる。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん様は\n仲良し！(シンプルに)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりは\nほし芋をくれた！(シンプルに)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなかんじ٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～ランダム返し～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント\n読みました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい言葉とか\nためになる話は\nすぐスクショしちゃう。\nいっぱいフォルダにたまってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに感謝***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきだよ"}],"source":"archive"}